<title>USA: AK Steel names James Wareham president.</title>
<headline>AK Steel names James Wareham president.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLETOWN, Ohio 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>AK Steel Corp said Thursday its board of directors has elected James Wareham president of the company. Wareham, 57, was formerly chairman, president and chief executive officer of Wheeling-Pittsburgh Steel Corp and president of WHX Corp.</p>
<p>He succeeds Richard Wardrop, who was named chairman of AK Steel in January and also holds the position of chief executive.</p>
